OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was taken to hospital, where she
OL,8,Fremained unconscious for days as
OL,9,Fmedical staff cleared her body of the
OL,10,Finjected chemical. Experts and her
OL,11,Flegal team say her apparent recovery is
OL,12,Funprecedented.
